# Python bytecode — build artifacts, never source of truth.
# mcp/__pycache__/nv-mcp.cpython-312.pyc had been committed since the
# keychain-secret-guard consolidation: it pins one interpreter version
# (3.12), goes stale the moment nv-mcp.py changes, and adds an opaque
# binary to a repo whose entire pitch is auditability.
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
